"either the shared product references or the variant references."
msgstr "一条参考号不能同时归属产品与产品变体：请选择共享参考号或变体参考号之一。"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_product_reference
msgid ""
"Attach several references to one product and find the product from any of "
"its references; the standard Odoo Reference is edited right under the "
"product name and the extra references are managed from the + button inside "
"it (a product with several variants keeps one set of references per "
"variant)"
msgstr ""
"一个产品可挂多条参考号，并可用任一参考号搜到产品；标准 Odoo Reference "
"在产品名称下方直接编辑，额外参考号通过其中的「+」按钮管理（多变体产品每个变体各自维护一组参考号）"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_reference
msgid ""
"\n"
"Product reference management module for foreign trade SOHO scenarios.\n"
"\n"
"Source language of this module is English (en_US); a Simplified Chinese\n"
"translation ships in i18n/zh_CN.po.\n"
"\n"
"Key features:\n"
"- The standard Odoo Reference (default_code) is edited directly under the\n"
"  product name, on both the product form and the product variant form;\n"
"  no extra tab is added to the product form\n"
"- The \"+\" button inside the Reference field opens a dialog listing the\n"
"  extra references of the product (or of the variant on a variant form):\n"
"  add, edit, reorder, disable and delete lines; changes are kept on the\n"
"  form record and are written when the record is saved (a brand new\n"
"  product can get references right away)\n"
"- A product with several variants does not share its references: the\n"
"  Reference block is hidden on the product form and every variant keeps\n"
"  its own set of references (variant references are independent from the\n"
"  shared product references, like the variant image gallery)\n"
"- When a product carries extra references, a \"+N\" badge appears next to\n"
"  the button and hovering it shows the list of references in a tooltip\n"
"- References live in a dedicated line model exposed as a One2many on\n"
"  product.template; they are never squeezed into a comma separated Char\n"
"- A reference cannot be repeated inside the same product; different\n"
"  products may share the same reference\n"
"- Search happens in the database: the stored redundant fields\n"
"  reference_code_index (product references) and\n"
"  variant_reference_code_index (variant references) are backed by trigram\n"
"  indexes; searching a product by the reference of one of its variants\n"
"  also finds the product\n"
"- Many2one dropdowns, search suggestions, quick search and the list\n"
"  search box all find a product by any of its references\n"
"- When a reference is hit, the result shows\n"
"  \"Product (Matching reference: xxx)\" so products can be told apart\n"
"- Reference lines are removed with the product, no orphan data\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"外贸 SOHO 场景下的产品参考号管理模块。\n"
"\n"
"本模块源语言为英文（en_US），简体中文译文见 i18n/zh_CN.po。\n"
"\n"
"主要功能：\n"
"- 标准 Odoo Reference（default_code）直接在产品名称下方编辑，产品表单与产品变体表单\n"
"  均可，不再额外增加标签页\n"
"- Reference 字段内的「+」按钮打开弹窗，列出该产品（变体表单上为该变体）的额外参考号：\n"
"  可新增、编辑、排序、停用与删除；改动先记在表单记录上，保存记录时统一写库\n"
"  （全新产品也能立即录入参考号）\n"
"- 多变体产品不共用参考号：产品表单隐藏 Reference 区块，每个变体各自维护一组参考号\n"
"  （与变体图库一致，变体参考号与共享参考号相互独立）\n"
"- 产品挂有额外参考号时，按钮旁出现「+N」徽标，悬停以 tooltip 显示参考号清单\n"
"- 参考号存放在独立的明细模型，并以 One2many 挂在 product.template 上，\n"
"  不塞进逗号分隔的 Char 字段\n"
"- 同一产品内参考号不可重复；不同产品之间允许重复\n"
"- 搜索在数据库层完成：冗余存储字段 reference_code_index（产品参考号）与\n"
"  variant_reference_code_index（变体参考号）配 trigram 索引；用变体的参考号也能搜到产品\n"
"- Many2one 下拉、搜索建议、快速搜索与列表搜索框都能按任一参考号找到产品\n"
"- 命中参考号时结果显示「产品（命中参考号：xxx）」，便于区分产品\n"
"- 参考号明细随产品删除，不留孤儿数据\n"
